<%= content_for :title, t('.titre') %>
<div class="background-full-color flex-container text-center">
	<div class="background-title flex-item">
		<h2>TO BECOME PARTNER</h2>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="info text-center">
	Boost funding for projects you support. <br>
Fiatope enables local and entrepreneurial initiatives to develop thanks to the solidarity of thousands of goodwill in the world.

</div>

<div class="container org">
	<div class="info-large">
	<h3> Interests for your organization</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>Bring the projects you accompany to a high visibility platform</li>
			<li> Find for the projects you accompany, sources of funding that you have not yet explored </li>
		</ul>

		<h3> Put your projects on a platform with increasing visibility</h3>
		<ul>
			<li> Your projects are online on www.fiatope.com and benefit from exposure to a patron base that grows every day. </li>
			<li>You have a space dedicated to your organization on www.fiatope.com.</li>
			<li> You can also broadcast as widely as you want the link of your campaign on Fiatope.</li>
		</ul>

		<h3> Find sources of funding you have not yet explored</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>Participational financing (crowdfunding) consists in financing a project not by traditional actors (banks, funds, etc.) but by a large number of anonymous persons, who contribute according to their wishes.</li>
			<li>This financial mode is one of the essential links of the solidarity economy. Its strong current development will allow a serious alternative to the financing of the global economy. In 2013, more than $ 5 billion is spent on this new form of financing. As a result, participatory financing is clearly a source of hope for the emergence of initiatives in the countries of the South.</li>
			<li> Fiatope is the first participatory financing actor dedicated to ambitious initiatives and projects aimed at the socio-economic development of francophone and anglophone African countries.</li>
		</ul>
		<h3> Types of Partnership</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>Thematic Partnership:
We work together in one or more areas of activity.</li>

				<li>Regional Partnership:
We work together in one or more anglophone or fracophone regions or countries of Africa.</li>

				</ul>

				<h3> Winner-Winner</h3>
				<ul>
					<li> You accelerate the financing of your projects and start-ups. We also assist you in presenting your project online and help you promote it.</li>
					<li> We benefit from your footprint and perimeter of action, as well as your experience in supporting the development and implementation of noble local emergencies initiatives.</li>
				</ul>    

				<h3> Contact Us </h3>
				<p class="text-center"> For any information request you can send us an email to contact@fiatope.com  </p>
				<div class="text-center">
					<%= link_to 'Contact us', new_message_path, class: 'btn btn-medium-red-nm text-center' %>
				</div>
			</div>
			
		</div>
